+// Adapts the official RS00 gripper motor to a logical gripper joint. By
+// default it is normalized: 0.0 is fully open and 1.0 is fully closed.
+// With the `stroke` device parameter (m, the finger travel from closed to
+// open) the joint is in SI units instead, as the gripper's prismatic finger
+// joint: position in m (0 closed, stroke open), velocity in m/s, and the
+// effort state in N (the motor torque through the ideal, lossless
+// transmission). The velocity command limits the speed in m/s then too.
+// The underlying RobStride protocol remains responsible for MIT encoding,
+// safe startup and feedback.
